#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to use the Sampler primitive with the IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API."
msgstr "Cómo usar la primitiva Sampler con la API REST de IBM Quantum Compute Service."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sampler with the REST API"
msgstr "Sampler con la API REST"

#. type: Plain text
