msgstr "2. Crear un circuit QASM {#2-create-a-qasm-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You need at least one circuit as the input to the Sampler primitive.\n"
msgstr "Necesitas al menos un circuit como entrada para el primitivo Sampler.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define a QASM quantum circuit:\n"
msgstr "Define un circuit cuántico QASM:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The code snippets given below assume that the `qasm_string` has been transpiled to a new string `resulting_qasm`.\n"
msgstr "Los fragmentos de código que se presentan a continuación asumen que el `qasm_string` ha sido transpilado a una nueva cadena `resulting_qasm`.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Run the quantum circuit using Sampler V2 API {#3-run-the-quantum-circuit-using-sampler-v2-api}"
msgstr "3. Ejecutar el circuit cuántico usando la API Sampler V2 {#3-run-the-quantum-circuit-using-sampler-v2-api}"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
#| "The jobs below use [Qiskit Runtime V2 primitives](/guides/v2-primitives). `SamplerV2` takes one or more primitive unified blocs (PUBs) as the input. Each PUB is a tuple that contains one circuit and the data broadcasted to that circuit, which can be multiple parameters, and returns one result per PUB.\n"
#| "</Admonition>\n"
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The jobs below use IBM Quantum V2 primitives. `SamplerV2` takes one or more primitive unified blocs (PUBs) as the input. Each PUB is a tuple that contains one circuit and the data broadcasted to that circuit, which can be multiple parameters, and returns one result per PUB.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Los trabajos a continuación usan [primitivos V2 de Qiskit Runtime](/guides/v2-primitives). `SamplerV2` toma uno o más bloques unificados primitivos (PUBs) como entrada. Cada PUB es una tupla que contiene un circuit y los datos difundidos a ese circuit, que pueden ser múltiples parámetros, y devuelve un resultado por PUB.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

